<!-- Hand-scribbled star — the actual "one continuous pen stroke without lifting"
     way people doodle a star: five straight lines jumping every other point of a
     pentagon, self-crossing in the middle, ending just short of where it started
     rather than closing neatly. Two overlapping passes (slightly different wobble
     each) fake a pen re-tracing its own doodle. Called with `class:` for
     positioning/sizing/animation-delay (see .home-intro__sparkle in _custom.scss). -->
